    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Standard-issue field knife. Single-edge, thumb groove, hard sheath that clips to a belt or boot. The first weapon most Stewards carry and the last one they put down. Honest steel — no signature, no story, just edge.</p><p>Light enough for off-hand work; close enough for the kind of conversation knives are for.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Light, finesse-friendly. No signature ability.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d6 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(blade)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Melee (Violence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Reach:</strong> Melee</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T2</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Bound Working — Strikethrough (TI).</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Carries the Working <strong>Strikethrough</strong>: it appears among your Manifestations as “Strikethrough ⟡ Combat Knife of Strikethrough” and casts from the item, <strong>no Clarity</strong> — Noise and misfire still apply.</li>\n  <li><strong>3 charges</strong>; one is spent per cast attempt; all recover on a Soma Break.</li>\n  <li><em>One target within 6 squares takes 1d6 psychic (stress); Mind defense vs Cast DC or Shaken for 1 round.</em></li>\n  <li>Tier II · attuned (one slot) · technomagical (Witness-forge binding).</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->"
    }
  },
